    <fullName>Schedule_Generation_Status__c</fullName>
    <description>Maker-checker lifecycle state for the payment schedule. Not_Generated → Draft (maker generates) → Pending_Review (submitted) → Active (checker approves). Superseded after an amendment replaces the active schedule. Spec v7 Part 5.2.1.2.</description>
